  "ruleText": "Agr 2301.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish fees for pesticide product registration pursuant to RSA 430:36.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Agr 2300) #10985, eff 11-25-15; ss by #14405, eff 10-17-25 EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
